  "title": "Announcing Brad Kosler as Vice President of Finance at American Woodmark",
  "summary": "American Woodmar is pleased to announce that Brad Kosler will join American Woodmark Corporation as our Vice President of Finance, effective July 10, 2023. He will report directly to the CFO as part of the finance leadership team. Brad will be responsible for leading the finance efforts to support our continued journey to Oracle in the cloud.",
